{"text": "There was a man of Hawaii named Keawe, who was poor but brave, and who could read and write like a schoolmaster. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a sailor, and one day his ship took him to San Francisco, a great city on the coast of America. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Walking up a hill in the city, he stopped in front of a small but beautiful house with bright windows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At one of the windows stood an old man, who looked out at Keawe with a face full of sadness. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What a fine house this is, thought Keawe, If I lived in a house like that, I would laugh all day long. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old man invited him inside and brought out a round bellied bottle with a long neck, made of glass as white as milk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> An imp lives in this bottle, said the old man, and Keawe saw something move inside it like a shadow and a fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was this very bottle, he said, that had made Napoleon the king of the world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But you must sell it for less than you paid, and if you die with it, you will burn in the fire forever. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old man had paid ninety dollars for it, and he sold it to Keawe for fifty, which was exactly all the money Keawe had.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "o", "f", " ", "H", "a", "w", "a", "i", "i", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", "d", " ", "K", "e", "a", "w", "e", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "b", "r", "a", "v", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "r", "e", "a", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "r", "i", "t", "e", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "s", "c", "h", "o", "o", "l", "m", "a", "s", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " "